flowchart LR
    A[Group admin\nowner or mod] -->|Schedule / start / end| API[NestJS API\nNode 20]
    M[Group member] -->|Read schedule / request join token| API
    API -->|Durable call state + invite snapshot| DB[(Supabase Postgres)]
    API -->|Reminder, ringing, missed-call events| N[Notification service]
    N --> EX[Expo / Web Push]
    N --> VP[APNs VoIP / FCM calling push]
    EX --> M
    VP --> M
    API -->|Idempotent prepare/end command| GW[Voice gateway\nNode 22 + WSS]
    API -->|Short-lived signed join token| M
    M -->|Signaling + DTLS-SRTP audio| GW
    GW --> W[mediasoup workers\n1 process per CPU core]
    W --> R[Router per live call]
    GW -. room assignment / presence .-> REDIS[(Redis when scaling past one node)]
    GW -->|Signed lifecycle callbacks| API
